00:00:18.719 --> 00:00:21.488 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On m'a piégé.

00:00:19.753 --> 00:00:22.489 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Avec ses plus de 75 millions

00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:23.523 size:53% position:73% line:53%
