00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:24.558 size:53% position:73% line:53%
elle a même dépassée

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:25.592 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la populaire série espagnole

00:00:23.824 --> 00:00:26.593 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Casa Del Papel...

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:27.594 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Vous devez tenir

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:28.629 size:53% position:73% line:53%
