00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:29.629 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- ...la série non anglophone

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:30.664 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la plus populaire sur Netflix.

00:00:28.929 --> 00:00:31.665 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- L'homme le plus recherché

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:32.699 size:53% position:73% line:53%
