00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:33.700 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Lupin, c'est l'histoire

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:34.701 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'Assane Diop, interprété

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:35.736 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par Omar Sy, un admirateur

00:00:34.001 --> 00:00:36.737 size:53% position:73% line:53%
