00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:51.918 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sur les réseaux sociaux

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:53.153 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des indices et des énigmes.

00:00:51.018 --> 00:00:54.354 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Par exemple, à la fin

00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:55.589 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la bande-annonce

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:56.790 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la nouvelle saison,

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:58.025 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un lien subtilement dissimulé

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:59.993 size:53% position:73% line:53%
nous guide vers un site Web qui

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:59.993 size:53% position:73% line:53%
